# Dai frontend environment. Copy to .env.local to override.
# VITE_* variables are compiled into the public bundle — NEVER put backend
# secrets, tokens or credentials in them.
#
# Where the backend API lives. The production default is /api on the same
# origin (the PWA expects this). Set it only when the backend is hosted
# elsewhere, e.g. during development:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api